OL,3,GNEWSAOverturned lorry causes delays on
OL,4,AA453 near airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn overturned lorry has led to
OL,7,F"significant disruption" on the A453
OL,8,Fnear East Midlands Airport.
OL,10,FEmergency services were at the scene of
OL,11,Fthe incident at Finger Farm Island near
OL,12,FCastle Donington at about 08:00 BST.
OL,14,FNational Highways confirmed the road
OL,15,Fwas shut southbound from the A6 for
OL,16,FKegworth and the A42 while the HGV was
OL,17,Fbeing recovered.
OL,19,FBus operator Trentbarton said both of
OL,20,Fits Skylink airport services were
OL,21,Faffected.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
